                <html:p>A <html:em>semantic category</html:em> is a <fr:link href="/sss-0005.xml" title="Biclosed Monoidal Category" addr="sss-0005" type="local">closed category</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[S]]></fr:tex> such that there is a semantic functor <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F : C \to  S]]></fr:tex> that preserves the closed structure.</html:p>
                <html:p>This notion is underwhelming, as it does not much insight into semantics nor does this paper give satisfying examples of semantics.</html:p>
              </fr:mainmatter>
